WEBVTT

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:14.820
Yeah.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.190
Everybody knows that I'm breaking down.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.080
Everybody knows I ain't faking now.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.890
Everybody knows my heart's vacant now.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:21.800
Yeah, she hates me now.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.820
I made mistakes, but now,

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.250
I don't ever wanna be alone.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.660
I don't really ever feel at home.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.100
On my own, in the zone.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.950
That's the only way I know, feeling low,

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.210
about to blow back up.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:32.129
Here I won't ever let the doubt creep in.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.090
Gotta pop a couple more aspirin.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.990
I don't think I'll ever let you in.

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:37.980
Easier to break it off as friends.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.830
I don't really understand myself.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.760
I don't really understand, need help.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.660
I don't wanna be left on the shelf.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:45.440
Couldn't even hear me if I yelled.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:49.110
It's so cold outside.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:52.570
I'm alone, I'm all right.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:01:00.060
It's so cold outside. I'm alone, I'm all right.

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:30.300
Yeah,

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:31.640
let's go.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.360
I don't wanna break down.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.780
Always feel like I could break now.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.730
But I never let it take me to that place now.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.610
I won't ever let my thoughts get away now.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.540
I got better things to do, picking fate now.

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.440
I just wanna be the best, call me great.

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.370
I don't know if I'm okay or insane now.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.150
I remember better days on the playground.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.320
Hoping I can find my way to a better
Even

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:48.980
when I'm feeling down, I fight.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.870
Even when I don't know what is right.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:52.800
I'ma pick a side, and I'ma take pride.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.020
I will decide my fate and I will never

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.660
let them tell me who I am.

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.540
If you try to shape me, I'll be damned.

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.460
Planted on the ground is where I stand.

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.230
Never give up, that was always the plan.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:05.960
It's so cold outside.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:09.700
I'm alone, I'm all right.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:16.860
It's so cold outside. I'm alone, I'm all right.
